# --- Private content: never committed --------------------------------------
# Your own books, textbooks and anything extracted from them live here.
private/*
!private/README.md

# Book and document files anywhere in the repo, in case one is dropped in by mistake.
# Test fixtures are generated by the tests themselves.
*.epub
*.kepub
*.mobi
*.azw3
*.pdf
*.djvu
*.docx
*.odt

